David Damerell  <damerell@chiark.greenend.org.uk> wrote:
>Quoting  Byron A Jeff <byron@cc.gatech.edu>:

>>3) Getting protection earlier means that you can ditch the heavy armor
>>required to keep up with the dungeon earlier.

>You consistently quote the benefit of the racket as 9 points of AC. This
>is not compatible with also claiming a benefit in terms of ditching heavy
>armour (and it's also bogus because the true benefit is 9 minus the
>protection that a non-racketeer, playing equally well, would expect to
